Abstract = {This experiment demonstrates that musicians who began training before
   age seven perform better on a rhythmic tapping task than musicians who
   began after the age of seven, when the two groups are matched for years
   of experience. These results support the idea that there may be a
   sensitive period in childhood for motor training, similar to that
   observed for language learning.},
