   Tahoe, CA, JUN, 2006},
Organization = {Summer Inst Cognit Neurosci},
Abstract = {Split-brain patients provide a fascinating look at some of the issues
   surrounding consciousness. We briefly review past. findings and insights
   gained from studying these patients. We discuss in more detail some of
   the more interesting (to us). findings since the last edition of this
   volume. We conclude by suggesting a modified version of signal detection
   theory that may shed some light on aspects of consciousness in these
   patients.},
